      "name": "an-agents-card-is-badged-as-an-agents",
      "why": "The roster label rides onto every card the sharer contributed, so the grid can say a MACHINE put this card here rather than merely that someone did — PRD-agent-connection §7.4. A badge that reads only \"Ada\" for an agent is the failure this carries the label to prevent.",
